.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-SVPD, charge -1, optimisation, orbitals localised. This calculation shows the F-...CH3CH2Cl complex both reactions start from, with F- hydrogen-bonded to a methyl hydrogen anti to the chlorine (F...H 1.659 Å, that C-H stretched to 1.144 Å against 1.101 Å), at -638.911671 Eh, the zero of energy for the SN2 and E2 calculations of this topic.
